# Binaries: never diffed, never line-ending-normalised. These rules cover the ones that ARE
# tracked — assets/Restart.dc6 is the only one today. The plugin's own pd2addons.dll is not: the
# merge that made one DLL out of three also added *.dll to .gitignore, so installing means
# building it first (see README). The three predecessors each shipped theirs; this one does not.
*.dll binary
*.exe binary
*.dc6 binary
*.png binary

# The DLL reads these at runtime, and it reads them on Windows, where CRLF is ordinary — the
# parsers tolerate either (sscanf stops at whitespace). Pinned to LF anyway so a diff between two
# machines is about the content.
*.txt text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
